{"id":67,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"体験と学問を両輪に未来を切り拓く佼成教育","feature_description":"佼成学園は、校訓「行学二道」に基づき、体験による人格の向上と学問による知識を両立させます。中学では学習習慣を身につけ、自ら学ぶ姿勢やコミュニケーション力、協働する力を育成します。男子校の環境で仲間と競い、支え合いながら挑戦する経験を重ね、興味・関心を進路へつなげて、自分の将来を切り拓く力を養います。中高6年間で、体験を知識と結び付け、学び続ける姿勢と自ら選択する力を育てます。","clubs":[{"id":727,"name":"中学野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kosei.ac.jp/boys/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":729,"name":"中学アメリカンフットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kosei.ac.jp/boys/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":731,"name":"中学サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kosei.ac.jp/boys/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":733,"name":"中学ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kosei.ac.jp/boys/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":735,"name":"中学バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kosei.ac.jp/boys/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":737,"name":"ハンドボール部（中・高）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kosei.ac.jp/boys/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":738,"name":"卓球部（中・高）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kosei.ac.jp/boys/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":739,"name":"陸上競技部（中・高）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kosei.ac.jp/boys/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":740,"name":"柔道部（中・高）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kosei.ac.jp/boys/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":741,"name":"剣道部（中・高）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kosei.ac.jp/boys/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":742,"name":"弓道部（中・高）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kosei.ac.jp/boys/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":743,"name":"水泳部（中・高）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kosei.ac.jp/boys/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":745,"name":"吹奏楽部（中・高）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kosei.ac.jp/boys/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":746,"name":"サイエンス部 生物・化学班（中・高）","category":"文化部"